      "heading": "A — Exam authority",
      "learner_facing": true,
      "markdown": "## A — Exam authority, Section Twelve Alcohol, Drugs and Driving\n\nThis dossier supports first-time never-licensed applicants preparing for the Class D non-commercial knowledge test in Oklahoma. The issuing authority is Service Oklahoma, and the source is the Oklahoma Driver Manual. The handbook states no official question count, passing score, test format, or time limit for the written test, so this dossier asserts no value for any of them. Practice scoring follows only the accepted LearningLoop product policy.\n",
